WEBVTT

01:25.800 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:36.400
You don't know
I once learned from a master.

01:36.480 --> 01:39.000
She's way better than you are
at this food-clash trick.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.640
First you meant to harm me,

01:45.720 --> 01:48.440
then you used banned drugs
and killed the birth mother.

01:48.520 --> 01:50.200
What are you after?

01:53.040 --> 01:54.400
Just delivering babies

01:55.040 --> 01:56.160
and doing good to earn merit.

01:56.800 --> 01:57.840
If you won't say,

01:57.920 --> 01:59.120
I'll have to ask

01:59.200 --> 02:01.240
my well-read friend here.

02:01.320 --> 02:02.160
Wuren.

02:02.240 --> 02:04.600
In Dvaravati, there's a dark art.

02:04.680 --> 02:07.400
They turn babies into gu kids,
feeding them with tainted blood.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.440
Then they do evil for their master.

02:09.520 --> 02:12.160
Using dark arts to take lives,

02:12.240 --> 02:13.560
how does the law sentence it?

02:13.640 --> 02:17.080
No pardon. Death. Executed on the spot.

02:17.160 --> 02:19.640
Are you raising a gu for Xu Daoyin?

02:21.320 --> 02:23.760
I've never even heard
of such a heartless dark art.

02:23.840 --> 02:24.840
How would I dare do that?

02:24.920 --> 02:27.080
Where did you take that baby?

02:27.600 --> 02:30.520
It lost its mother right after its birth.

02:30.600 --> 02:33.200
So we sent it to Vitality Hall
to be cared for by a wet nurse.

02:34.160 --> 02:36.840
Mr. Xu is generous, kind at heart,

02:37.440 --> 02:38.920
and he's never meant harm.

02:39.960 --> 02:40.800
Your Ladyship,

02:40.880 --> 02:43.000
please don't misunderstand us.

02:43.080 --> 02:46.200
So you're saying we got it wrong?

02:48.280 --> 02:49.280
You're full of it!

02:52.200 --> 02:53.440
What makes you say that?

02:53.520 --> 02:55.560
This woman colluded with Xu Daoyin,

02:55.640 --> 02:58.680
using this manor as a cover,
to rob and kill!

02:58.760 --> 02:59.760
That's nonsense!

03:00.280 --> 03:03.680
Your Ladyship, could he be
the killer in this manor?

03:05.120 --> 03:06.120
That's right.

03:06.640 --> 03:08.360
Now it's your turn!

03:12.200 --> 03:13.400
Lady Yue.

03:20.840 --> 03:23.960
After such a huge mess here,
you can still deliver on time.

03:24.040 --> 03:26.240
Wu family's money wasn't wasted!

03:27.360 --> 03:28.280
Madam, you haven't left yet?

03:28.360 --> 03:30.280
You think sending her away

03:30.360 --> 03:32.840
would keep your filthy deal with Xu

03:32.920 --> 03:34.240
from being exposed?

03:42.080 --> 03:43.560
This so-called business of Mr. Xu

03:44.280 --> 03:47.160
is timing a baby's birth to a set hour,

03:47.240 --> 03:50.000
to fix a patron's missing element,

03:50.080 --> 03:52.280
and bring luck, not bad omens.

03:56.480 --> 03:57.840
You should've left earlier!

04:13.120 --> 04:14.480
- Don't let Lady Yue get away!
- Got it!

04:24.880 --> 04:25.920
Help out already!

04:59.760 --> 05:00.600
Nice moves!

05:03.400 --> 05:05.600
Investigating Commissioner Su Kuangyuan.
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.480
Thank you for your help.

05:14.160 --> 05:16.960
Shouldn't you be thanking me
for thinking ahead

05:17.040 --> 05:18.360
and calling reinforcements in time?

05:18.440 --> 05:19.560
Just as expected.

05:22.040 --> 05:23.200
Your Ladyship,

05:23.720 --> 05:25.920
Lady Yue likely took
the secret passage and got away.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.480
Where's the exit?

05:28.560 --> 05:30.360
Tunnels run all through the manor,

05:30.440 --> 05:32.600
with many exits leading everywhere.

05:33.120 --> 05:34.120
I don't know.

05:35.440 --> 05:36.920
There should be blueprints.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.400
Xiao…

05:39.480 --> 05:41.680
Xiao's been with Mr. Xu over three years.

05:41.760 --> 05:43.840
He's the one Mr. Xu trusts most.

05:44.360 --> 05:47.040
After Xiao came,
they started building the tunnels.

05:47.120 --> 05:48.200
Where is he?

05:48.880 --> 05:50.520
Since Mr. Xu vanished,

05:50.600 --> 05:52.560
Xiao's been praying at the living shrine.

06:13.480 --> 06:15.680
WITHIN MISFORTUNE, FORTUNE RESTS
WITHIN FORTUNE, MISFORTUNE WAITS

06:17.840 --> 06:21.720
To keep the manor's fortune flowing,

06:21.800 --> 06:24.320
Mr. Xu built several secret tunnels.

06:24.920 --> 06:27.240
The tunnels all connect,

06:27.320 --> 06:28.400
with many entrances.

06:28.480 --> 06:31.280
But the exits are not complicated,

06:31.360 --> 06:32.840
just well hidden.

06:33.960 --> 06:36.920
They're at the spots I marked.

06:37.840 --> 06:41.320
Most exits seal perfectly tight.
Can they be opened from outside?

06:43.120 --> 06:44.960
Of course they can.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.760
Metal begets water.

06:46.840 --> 06:49.640
This exit is near the stream,
so there must be white marble nearby.

06:49.720 --> 06:50.640
That's where the mechanism is.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.360
Same for the other exits.

06:52.440 --> 06:53.560
Just follow
the five elements' generating cycle

06:53.640 --> 06:55.040
and you'll find them.

06:56.480 --> 06:58.480
Just as you said, sir.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.200
Once you find the mechanism,

07:00.280 --> 07:01.600
turn it right three times,

07:02.200 --> 07:03.560
and the exit will open.

07:04.280 --> 07:06.360
Split up and search.
Signal if you find anything.

07:09.000 --> 07:10.880
Chasing killers isn't your strength.
Where are you going?

07:12.440 --> 07:14.880
That mechanism is interesting.
I'm going to take a look.

07:21.160 --> 07:25.000
If there's nothing else I can help with,

07:25.080 --> 07:26.680
I'll take my leave.

07:33.520 --> 07:34.480
Let's go check on Madam Wu.

07:46.280 --> 07:48.120
This baby isn't full-term yet

07:49.040 --> 07:51.040
and doesn't even have the strength to cry.

07:53.520 --> 07:55.360
- You may leave.
- Yes, Madam.

08:00.120 --> 08:00.960
Your Ladyship, please sit.

08:10.120 --> 08:11.520
The night my uncle was killed,

08:12.240 --> 08:14.360
- were you really drugged unconscious?
- Don't slander Madam!

08:20.080 --> 08:22.680
You can tell I hated him to the bone.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.720
The year something happened
to your family,

08:29.800 --> 08:32.600
my husband suddenly
claimed illness and quit office.

08:33.400 --> 08:35.559
I knew it wasn't what he wanted,

08:35.640 --> 08:37.159
but I didn't press.

08:37.240 --> 08:39.480
I went with him back to Ping'en County.

08:39.559 --> 08:41.159
CHUNMING GATE

08:42.240 --> 08:44.280
That house in Ping'en County

08:44.360 --> 08:46.400
was my family's ancestral property.

08:47.160 --> 08:49.720
We settled down there, living quietly.

08:50.400 --> 08:53.600
And I had a knack for business.

08:53.680 --> 08:56.800
Before long, I built up an enterprise.

08:57.320 --> 08:59.480
Life there was even more comfortable

08:59.560 --> 09:01.200
than in the Western Capital.

09:03.920 --> 09:06.440
After a year, I became pregnant

09:06.960 --> 09:09.440
and handed the business to him.

09:10.480 --> 09:13.200
Back then, nothing went smoothly.

09:13.720 --> 09:16.640
All our hard work was about to be wasted.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.560
My husband tried everything

09:18.640 --> 09:21.120
to save the business, but nothing changed.

09:21.840 --> 09:23.840
That's when he began worshiping Mr. Xu?

09:24.480 --> 09:26.320
He worried about the business,

09:26.400 --> 09:28.200
gloomy all day.

09:29.400 --> 09:30.800
Until one day,

09:31.320 --> 09:33.400
the house suddenly filled
with gongs and drums.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.200
Later I learned

09:35.920 --> 09:38.400
he had brought home a statue.

09:50.720 --> 09:51.560
Master,

09:54.800 --> 09:55.920
what is this?

09:58.960 --> 10:00.880
My lady, what are you doing here?

10:01.880 --> 10:03.120
You're with child.

10:03.200 --> 10:04.800
Don't offend the Immortal

10:04.880 --> 10:06.040
with any trace of blood.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.720
- Master…
- My lady…

10:09.200 --> 10:10.160
- Madam.
- My lady.

10:10.240 --> 10:12.040
- Master!
- Step aside for now.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.600
He was devout to Mr. Xu,

10:17.520 --> 10:19.840
burning incense and chanting daily.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.440
Even his clothes, food, and routines

10:22.520 --> 10:24.680
followed Mr. Xu's instructions
to the letter.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.720
But with me,

10:27.800 --> 10:32.120
he was kinder than before,
looking after me in every way.

10:33.160 --> 10:35.640
And he was eagerly awaiting
the baby's birth.

10:36.560 --> 10:37.400
My lady.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.040
Stay back!

10:39.120 --> 10:42.680
Careful, I'm covered in blood.
I might offend you!

10:42.760 --> 10:43.600
My lady.

10:44.360 --> 10:46.960
I panicked just now
and spoke without thinking.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.840
I made you angry.

10:49.480 --> 10:51.240
It's all my fault. It's all my fault.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.120
My lady.

10:53.840 --> 10:56.440
Mr. Xu is truly powerful.

10:57.000 --> 10:59.040
He can bless our unborn child

10:59.120 --> 11:00.440
to be safe and easy to raise.

11:00.520 --> 11:02.160
He can also bless our business

11:02.240 --> 11:03.960
to reach the next level.

11:05.720 --> 11:07.360
Master,

11:07.440 --> 11:09.880
business is made by people.

11:09.960 --> 11:12.040
If worship and incense

11:12.120 --> 11:13.600
could make wishes come true,

11:13.680 --> 11:15.920
then everyone would just do it.

11:17.080 --> 11:19.480
You always scoffed at spirits and omens.

11:19.560 --> 11:22.400
How could you believe
such lowbrow nonsense?

11:23.280 --> 11:24.360
My lady.

11:24.440 --> 11:27.480
Better safe than sorry.

11:27.560 --> 11:30.200
My lady, just focus on the pregnancy.

11:30.280 --> 11:32.880
Pretend our home
doesn't have that scripture hall.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.920
That was because of Xu Daoyin?

11:43.200 --> 11:47.200
To support Mr. Xu, he spent a fortune.

11:47.280 --> 11:48.680
I didn't care about that.

11:50.040 --> 11:52.200
What moved me
was how much he cared for me.

11:53.120 --> 11:56.120
But since he believed a pregnant woman

11:56.640 --> 11:59.320
could offend the deities with blood,

12:00.320 --> 12:02.600
how could he suddenly change

12:02.680 --> 12:04.440
and be so attentive to me?

12:07.560 --> 12:08.760
Back then,

12:08.840 --> 12:10.920
I never noticed that part.

12:11.880 --> 12:12.920
Then that child…

12:18.360 --> 12:19.320
By that logic,

12:19.840 --> 12:21.120
he brought Wu Mujin home

12:21.640 --> 12:23.480
soon after you miscarried.

12:25.480 --> 12:28.600
He admitted Wu Mujin was a bastard,

12:29.560 --> 12:31.200
afraid I'd mind.

12:31.880 --> 12:33.240
At the time,

12:33.760 --> 12:37.800
I felt ashamed that I couldn't
carry on the Wu line.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.120
So I accepted the child.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.240
Who's the mother?

12:42.160 --> 12:43.160
I never asked.

12:43.800 --> 12:45.120
He never said either.

12:45.760 --> 12:46.880
He raised the child

12:46.960 --> 12:49.160
alone in a side courtyard

12:49.680 --> 12:52.840
and even set up
some strange formation there.

12:54.640 --> 12:56.760
The child looked frail and pitiful,

12:56.840 --> 12:58.520
but he told me not to worry.

12:59.400 --> 13:01.720
Still, it felt wrong.

13:02.520 --> 13:04.760
So I had Wu Lie look into it in secret.

13:12.760 --> 13:15.120
I found out that child
wasn't just a bastard.

13:15.200 --> 13:17.760
Master was after his own smooth fortune,

13:17.840 --> 13:19.880
so he had Xu Daoyin find poor women

13:19.960 --> 13:22.600
to bear him children with lucky fates.

13:22.680 --> 13:25.520
In Vitality Hall at the manor,
there were many pregnant women.

13:26.040 --> 13:29.120
Under the guise of cultivation,

13:29.640 --> 13:31.720
Xu Daoyin was secretly doing dirty deals

13:32.760 --> 13:34.680
for rich merchants and landlords.

13:34.760 --> 13:37.200
To make the babies
be born at the chosen time,

13:37.280 --> 13:38.960
they forced medicine down the mothers!

13:39.040 --> 13:41.320
Most of the mothers were already weak

13:41.400 --> 13:43.840
and couldn't withstand such strong drugs!

13:43.920 --> 13:46.120
But to get the babies,

13:46.200 --> 13:47.720
they cared nothing for the mothers!

13:48.520 --> 13:50.520
Wu Siping's crimes go even further!

13:50.600 --> 13:52.800
He even laid hands on his own wife.

13:55.440 --> 13:57.560
So Madam, you had
a premature delivery too?

14:02.120 --> 14:03.600
Not until Wu Lie

14:04.440 --> 14:07.640
brought back from the manor
the dregs of Tuohua Decoction

14:08.520 --> 14:09.720
did I realize

14:11.360 --> 14:13.200
what he made me drink before

14:13.280 --> 14:15.760
wasn't a pregnancy tonic at all.

14:16.640 --> 14:19.560
He wouldn't even spare
his own wife and child.

14:20.360 --> 14:22.560
Madam, why didn't you expose him?

14:23.720 --> 14:24.760
I tried.

14:25.440 --> 14:26.640
But he said

14:26.720 --> 14:29.000
it was all for the family's business,

14:29.080 --> 14:32.040
so I could live in luxury.

14:32.120 --> 14:34.400
He wept and begged my forgiveness.

14:35.160 --> 14:37.120
I wanted to leave him,

14:37.640 --> 14:39.480
but old feelings remained.

14:39.560 --> 14:40.640
Besides,

14:41.160 --> 14:42.520
if I left,

14:43.320 --> 14:45.560
that child wouldn't live much longer.

14:46.240 --> 14:48.960
So you secretly switched
the medicine Mr. Xu gave Wu Mujin

14:50.160 --> 14:52.720
and had Wu Lie disrupt
the layout of the side courtyard,

14:52.800 --> 14:53.880
all to protect him.

15:01.520 --> 15:02.800
I know.

15:02.880 --> 15:05.400
My husband has gone mad.

15:06.240 --> 15:09.160
Even if Mujin's health improved a little,

15:09.240 --> 15:12.680
he'd suspect his fortune
would weaken because of it.

15:13.440 --> 15:15.840
If business hit a snag,

15:15.920 --> 15:17.920
he'd take it out on Wu Mujin.

15:18.520 --> 15:21.280
I didn't dare let
Wu Mujin get too healthy,

15:21.360 --> 15:22.960
but I feared he'd die.

15:26.120 --> 15:27.880
Then how did you learn

15:27.960 --> 15:29.400
about that baby just now?

15:32.040 --> 15:33.840
I saw he wasn't as harsh

15:33.920 --> 15:35.440
to Wu Mujin as before,

15:36.280 --> 15:38.840
and he had people
renovating another house.

15:39.840 --> 15:41.040
He wouldn't say it,

15:41.120 --> 15:44.080
but I knew he wouldn't
do that for no reason.

15:44.160 --> 15:47.640
Mujin's birth mother is already missing.

15:48.440 --> 15:51.720
Now I'm afraid another woman
is about to suffer.

15:53.120 --> 15:56.040
All because of his greed and selfishness.

15:58.080 --> 15:59.880
All these years,

16:00.840 --> 16:04.720
I've wished the evil he did
would come back on him.

16:06.360 --> 16:07.880
I wanted him dead.

16:10.800 --> 16:12.160
But I couldn't do it.

16:13.200 --> 16:16.280
I'm not that smart and not that brave.

16:17.280 --> 16:18.960
All I could do

16:19.720 --> 16:22.280
was find a way to take that woman away

16:22.360 --> 16:23.480
before she gave birth.

16:24.640 --> 16:26.080
But your husband

16:26.160 --> 16:27.880
wouldn't let you know Liu's due date.

16:28.600 --> 16:30.680
The new house is finished.

16:31.400 --> 16:34.040
He planned to come
to Qingtan Town these days.

16:34.680 --> 16:35.840
That's when I knew

16:37.440 --> 16:38.600
the time was near.

16:39.480 --> 16:42.280
Madam feared they'd use
Tuohua Decoction to induce labor,

16:42.360 --> 16:43.600
so she told me to come early.

16:44.560 --> 16:46.320
Who knew Master would meet with disaster?

16:46.920 --> 16:49.920
And I lost some time trying to confirm

16:50.440 --> 16:51.440
who the mother was

16:52.040 --> 16:53.240
and couldn't stop Lady Yue.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.640
But Wu Siping…

16:57.720 --> 17:01.280
really should taste
Tuohua Decoction himself.

17:28.920 --> 17:29.880
It's dusty here.

17:29.960 --> 17:32.320
Lady Yue likely
didn't leave from this way.

17:47.200 --> 17:48.760
Mr. Su found nothing either.

17:49.360 --> 17:50.200
Let's check elsewhere.

17:51.960 --> 17:53.000
Wait.

18:05.280 --> 18:06.800
Mr. Xiao.

18:37.560 --> 18:38.720
What's this?

18:39.440 --> 18:40.280
A signal marker.

18:42.440 --> 18:43.360
If I'm not wrong,

18:43.440 --> 18:46.360
every junction in these tunnels
has one of these markers.

18:46.440 --> 18:48.600
Beak pointing down means it's blocked.

18:48.680 --> 18:50.720
Beak pointing forward means it's safe.

18:51.560 --> 18:53.040
Someone was signaling Lady Yue.

18:53.120 --> 18:54.960
Warn Su Kuangyuan
to check the other exits.

18:55.560 --> 18:56.800
Alright.

18:59.080 --> 19:00.280
- Follow me.
- Understood.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.880
Madam Wu hates her husband,

19:17.960 --> 19:19.160
but she's too soft-hearted.

19:20.840 --> 19:22.040
She's not the killer.

19:23.840 --> 19:26.000
My uncle's death
was almost the same as Liu's,

19:26.600 --> 19:28.440
upper body hanged from a beam above,

19:28.520 --> 19:30.200
lower body soaked in fresh blood.

19:31.200 --> 19:34.120
The killer must've seen
how the mother died

19:34.200 --> 19:35.680
and used this to take revenge.

19:36.320 --> 19:37.600
That means

19:38.200 --> 19:39.960
the killer is likely
connected to Wu Mujin.

19:40.960 --> 19:42.840
We need to find out fast
where Wu Mujin's birth mother is.

19:44.960 --> 19:45.880
I'll go see the midwife.

19:54.640 --> 19:55.920
Mr. Xu said

19:56.720 --> 19:59.800
as long as we help these women give birth,

19:59.880 --> 20:02.560
we'll build up merit and ascend sooner.

20:02.640 --> 20:05.000
We were forbidden to ask

20:05.080 --> 20:06.800
about the mothers' identities.

20:06.880 --> 20:09.880
I truly didn't mean to hide anything.

20:10.760 --> 20:13.720
If you want to ascend,
why go through all that trouble?

20:16.720 --> 20:17.560
I'll help you.

20:19.360 --> 20:20.560
This decoction…

20:21.640 --> 20:23.000
You've brewed it so many times,

20:23.800 --> 20:24.960
but you've never tasted
it yourself, have you?

20:25.720 --> 20:28.400
That's not for us to drink.

20:30.240 --> 20:31.320
Oh, I almost forgot it.

20:32.760 --> 20:34.200
Before drinking it…

20:37.200 --> 20:38.040
My lady!

20:38.120 --> 20:39.560
…you have to bleed a little first, right?

20:39.640 --> 20:41.360
Spare me, my lady!

20:41.440 --> 20:42.520
Please!

20:42.600 --> 20:44.160
I don't know anything…

20:44.720 --> 20:46.160
I don't know anything!

20:46.240 --> 20:47.680
Let's see…

20:48.280 --> 20:51.160
Where should I start to do it best?

20:51.680 --> 20:53.160
My lady, spare me!

20:53.240 --> 20:54.160
Spare me!

20:54.240 --> 20:57.040
I… I'll talk!

20:57.120 --> 20:58.240
I'll talk…

20:58.320 --> 20:59.440
Stand up and speak.

20:59.520 --> 21:01.760
Thank you, officer lady!
Thank you, officer lady!

21:02.360 --> 21:03.440
Thank you, my lady…

21:04.840 --> 21:06.080
Get up.

21:07.320 --> 21:08.560
I'll tell you…

21:10.280 --> 21:11.440
I…

21:12.040 --> 21:12.880
truly don't know

21:12.960 --> 21:16.000
who was the mother
bearing the child for Master Wu.

21:17.160 --> 21:20.560
But these poor women in Vitality Hall

21:20.640 --> 21:22.040
weren't pregnant by accident.

21:22.120 --> 21:25.440
They were here to bear children
for those patrons with money.

21:25.520 --> 21:28.320
As long as they give birth on time,

21:28.400 --> 21:30.120
the deal is settled.

21:30.200 --> 21:33.160
After that, they have nothing to do
with those patrons ever again.

21:33.240 --> 21:36.600
If they want kids,
why not have their own wives bear them?

21:40.160 --> 21:42.320
To make the child

21:42.400 --> 21:44.480
be born at an auspicious hour,

21:44.560 --> 21:46.920
nearly every mother-to-be

21:47.000 --> 21:49.800
had to take
this Tuohua Decoction to induce labor.

21:50.600 --> 21:53.640
But it's terribly harmful.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.440
Those rich households

21:55.520 --> 21:58.280
can't bear to make their own women
suffer like this.

21:58.360 --> 22:01.320
Some also fear

22:01.400 --> 22:05.520
the wife's powerful family,
so they won't risk it.

22:06.200 --> 22:07.680
So these women

22:07.760 --> 22:09.920
should suffer this and take the risk?

22:14.200 --> 22:15.040
We've checked.

22:15.120 --> 22:16.600
All the exits show the same signal,

22:16.680 --> 22:19.080
nor is there any trace of Lady Yue.

22:19.160 --> 22:20.000
Maybe

22:20.080 --> 22:22.000
- she was never in the tunnels?
- No.

22:29.840 --> 22:30.680
They follow the Celestial Market pattern.

22:31.560 --> 22:32.680
Okay, Mr. Xiao.

22:43.520 --> 22:45.440
The northeast
is governed by the Butcher's Star.

22:45.520 --> 22:46.880
It rules over slaughter.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.960
Those signal markers
were meant to lure her into a death trap.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.120
But there's no exit

22:52.640 --> 22:53.600
in the northeast.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.320
Follow me.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.840
Keep up.

23:06.160 --> 23:07.280
At daybreak,

23:07.360 --> 23:09.080
you can leave the manor.

23:10.520 --> 23:12.560
Leave… the manor? Where would we go?

23:14.400 --> 23:16.240
Home, of course.

23:16.320 --> 23:19.160
Xu Daoyin is missing,
and Lady Yue got away.

23:19.240 --> 23:21.360
You won't have to bear children
for them anymore.

23:21.440 --> 23:23.480
We can go home… We can go home now…

23:23.560 --> 23:25.560
But the baby's already inside me.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.000
How can I just not give birth?

23:28.960 --> 23:31.200
Go home and rest.

23:31.280 --> 23:34.160
When you're full-term,
give birth in peace and safety.

23:34.240 --> 23:36.360
You can't end up like Liu tonight,

23:37.160 --> 23:38.240
dying in childbirth.

23:39.000 --> 23:40.200
How do we raise them?

23:41.440 --> 23:42.680
Lady Yue's gone.

23:43.200 --> 23:45.600
Where do I get my money?

23:45.680 --> 23:47.320
What about our pay?

23:47.920 --> 23:49.040
What about the baby?

23:50.960 --> 23:53.240
Miss, what are you doing?

23:55.160 --> 23:57.120
I already have three kids.

23:57.200 --> 23:59.840
I was counting on this one

23:59.920 --> 24:01.160
to earn money and get by.

24:01.920 --> 24:02.880
Now…

24:03.600 --> 24:05.360
you're sending me back like this?

24:05.960 --> 24:06.840
My husband

24:07.480 --> 24:08.520
will beat me to death.

24:09.840 --> 24:11.680
He'll kill me!

24:12.400 --> 24:13.520
I can't live!

24:14.240 --> 24:16.080
I can't live!

24:23.280 --> 24:25.200
A friend from my village knew

24:26.520 --> 24:27.760
how poor we are.

24:28.640 --> 24:30.040
She told me this manor

24:30.560 --> 24:32.320
had work that paid well,

24:32.400 --> 24:34.240
so I came with her.

24:36.440 --> 24:38.320
But only after I got here

24:39.880 --> 24:41.880
did I learn it was birthing for the rich.

24:45.000 --> 24:46.480
At first I refused.

24:48.000 --> 24:48.920
But Lady Yue said

24:50.000 --> 24:51.720
if we delivered the baby,

24:51.800 --> 24:53.040
we'd get ten strings of coins.

24:53.120 --> 24:54.720
That's what she told us too.

24:54.800 --> 24:56.320
Yeah, she told us the same.

24:56.400 --> 24:59.080
Once you're pregnant,
you get three strings.

24:59.160 --> 25:01.560
After birth, you get seven more.

25:01.640 --> 25:03.760
Better than starving outside.

25:03.840 --> 25:05.120
Liu San and Lady Yue

25:05.200 --> 25:06.440
told my husband

25:06.520 --> 25:08.240
an immortal gave Mr. Xu a dream,

25:09.400 --> 25:11.080
and I was chosen to serve at the manor.

25:13.000 --> 25:14.040
After a year,

25:14.680 --> 25:15.680
I'd be sent home.

25:16.600 --> 25:17.760
Your family even believed

25:18.280 --> 25:19.520
that kind of talk?

25:20.400 --> 25:22.280
With three strings of coins up front…

25:24.480 --> 25:26.040
of course they'd believe.

25:26.760 --> 25:30.360
Tuohua Decoction is extremely risky.
Weren't you afraid of dying in childbirth?

25:32.800 --> 25:34.240
Fine then.

25:37.320 --> 25:40.400
Understood. Rest here for now.

25:40.920 --> 25:42.600
I'll handle what comes next.

25:44.520 --> 25:45.520
Take care of them.

25:46.160 --> 25:47.000
Understood.

26:10.640 --> 26:11.680
Don't run around.

26:31.600 --> 26:34.000
Lady Yue knew about the tunnels.

26:34.760 --> 26:36.160
She knew them well.

26:39.600 --> 26:42.520
But the killer knew better
all the hidden tricks inside.

26:42.600 --> 26:44.760
All he had to do was flip
the signal markers,

26:44.840 --> 26:46.200
wait at the exit,

26:46.280 --> 26:47.280
and effortlessly

26:47.360 --> 26:49.320
lead Lady Yue into his killing trap.

26:49.400 --> 26:51.400
The bell tower isn't far from the exit.

26:51.480 --> 26:53.800
Looks like when he killed her,
he'd already planned

26:53.880 --> 26:55.080
to leave her here.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.720
The bell ringer would find her
at the Hour of Yin.

27:02.760 --> 27:04.120
Strangled.

27:05.040 --> 27:06.720
The scene wasn't nearly
as bloody as before.

27:06.800 --> 27:08.920
The killer went easy on Lady Yue?

27:10.000 --> 27:11.760
Maybe he was pressed for time.

27:17.640 --> 27:20.160
She must've torn it off from the killer
during the struggle.

27:20.880 --> 27:22.080
The killer is injured.

27:23.440 --> 27:24.840
This gauze smells of incense.

27:25.640 --> 27:28.640
We just can't tell
if it's from Lady Yue or the killer.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.400
Wu Siping, the patron,

27:30.920 --> 27:32.320
Liu San, the conman,

27:32.400 --> 27:34.480
and Lady Yue, forcing labor, are all dead.

27:35.280 --> 27:36.960
No reason to spare Xu Daoyin.

27:39.360 --> 27:41.800
Could Xu Daoyin
already be silenced and buried?

27:41.880 --> 27:44.920
The killer drew attention
with those three deaths

27:45.000 --> 27:47.480
to expose all their wicked deeds.

27:47.560 --> 27:48.720
Why would he let Xu Daoyin live?

27:55.920 --> 27:57.360
Xu Daoyin was superstitious.

27:57.440 --> 27:59.640
The "money-direction" window
would never be opened.

28:08.640 --> 28:09.720
LIVING SHRINE

28:33.960 --> 28:35.000
Who's in there?

28:37.640 --> 28:38.920
- Break the door?
- Wait.

28:45.320 --> 28:46.160
It's a magnet!

29:14.800 --> 29:15.920
Mr. Gu.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.640
His belly is packed with gold cakes.

29:38.240 --> 29:39.800
They must be offerings from patrons.

29:39.880 --> 29:40.840
And his teeth

29:40.920 --> 29:42.240
show signs of breaking.

29:43.600 --> 29:46.760
The killer forced the gold cakes
into Xu Daoyin's mouth.

29:46.840 --> 29:48.360
He clenched his teeth and fought,

29:49.480 --> 29:50.840
and his teeth got snapped.

29:52.520 --> 29:54.360
The killer's hand was likely bitten.

29:55.040 --> 29:56.360
The lock is controlled by magnets.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.400
When the magnetic ball
drops into the slot, the door opens,

29:59.200 --> 30:01.000
but it also triggers a mechanism above,

30:01.080 --> 30:02.720
cutting the string holding a dagger.

30:02.800 --> 30:05.840
With his belly stuffed with gold cakes,
he was weighed down in pain.

30:05.920 --> 30:07.200
All he wanted was a quick death.

30:07.280 --> 30:08.840
If someone cracked the lock,

30:09.360 --> 30:10.720
the moment the door opened,

30:10.800 --> 30:12.160
he could grab the dagger

30:12.240 --> 30:13.560
and cut himself open.

30:13.640 --> 30:16.840
But if no one found him here,
he'd only die in swollen pain.

30:16.920 --> 30:19.360
He deliberately hid
the northeast exit on the map.

30:19.440 --> 30:20.520
I should've known it was him.

30:21.120 --> 30:23.920
So, the incense smell you caught
on the gauze in Lady Yue's hand

30:24.000 --> 30:24.880
came from Xiao?

30:24.960 --> 30:26.600
He killed those four.

30:27.200 --> 30:28.920
So it really is tied to Wu Mujin.

30:30.920 --> 30:32.920
I couldn't bear children.

30:33.000 --> 30:35.480
My husband brought him home from outside.

30:37.840 --> 30:40.160
My daughter made it for me.

30:40.240 --> 30:41.160
Find Xiao now!

30:46.440 --> 30:47.640
Did you see someone leave?

30:47.720 --> 30:49.840
A man, 40 or 50,

30:49.920 --> 30:50.960
dark-skinned,

30:51.040 --> 30:52.840
- with a black birthmark on his temple?
- Yes.

30:53.760 --> 30:55.320
He left two kes ago.

30:56.320 --> 30:58.240
I told you to lock down the manor!
Why did you let him pass?

30:58.320 --> 31:00.320
He… He was riding your horse.

31:00.400 --> 31:03.240
He said it was on your orders
to go for help.

31:04.920 --> 31:05.760
Mr. Xiao,

31:05.840 --> 31:08.040
my fast horse runs
hundreds of miles a day.

31:08.120 --> 31:10.680
In two kes,
he'd be long past Qingtan Town,

31:10.760 --> 31:11.720
beyond chasing.

31:11.800 --> 31:12.960
Don't worry.

31:13.040 --> 31:14.320
I'll get your fast horse back.

31:25.920 --> 31:28.480
Xiao took the shortcut on horseback.
Can we really catch him

31:29.000 --> 31:29.840
taking the waterway?

31:31.280 --> 31:32.880
The west wind is strong now.

31:32.960 --> 31:35.480
We're going with the current
and riding the wind as well.

31:36.080 --> 31:38.680
No matter how fast your horse is,
it can't outrun us.

31:44.440 --> 31:46.520
Xiao's left thumb web and back of hand

31:46.600 --> 31:48.160
have old scars,

31:48.240 --> 31:50.120
and his right middle finger
has a long scar too.

31:50.200 --> 31:52.480
They're marks left
from years of planing and sawing.

31:52.560 --> 31:54.080
He used to be a carpenter.

31:54.880 --> 31:57.320
And Xu Daoyin's fingers
are soft and delicate.

31:57.400 --> 31:59.080
No way he could build mechanisms.

31:59.760 --> 32:01.840
Xiao came to the manor three years ago.

32:01.920 --> 32:02.880
Before that,

32:02.960 --> 32:05.120
Xu Daoyin would sometimes
put on little "miracles,"

32:05.200 --> 32:07.320
but he never performed
the beheading trick.

32:07.920 --> 32:11.080
After Xiao arrived,
Xu Daoyin's "powers" improved overnight,

32:11.160 --> 32:12.440
and he trusted him for no reason.

32:12.520 --> 32:15.240
Tianruo even saw Xiao
repairing the altar mechanisms.

32:16.080 --> 32:17.760
Did you learn anything about Xiao's past?

32:18.560 --> 32:20.120
He rarely spoke of it.

32:20.640 --> 32:22.280
All we know is,
he has a daughter who's already married.

32:25.480 --> 32:27.520
Li Peiyi didn't go back
to the Western Capital.

32:27.600 --> 32:29.080
She detoured to Ping'en County.

32:29.160 --> 32:30.640
To see who?

32:31.520 --> 32:32.520
Wu Siping.

32:33.040 --> 32:35.040
He was Crown Prince's Left Guard Commander
15 years ago.

32:36.360 --> 32:37.640
One of the Crown Prince's men?

32:38.640 --> 32:39.720
What does he know?

32:39.800 --> 32:41.040
Not sure yet.

32:42.960 --> 32:44.560
Then eliminate them all.

32:45.560 --> 32:46.560
And Li Peiyi…

32:47.360 --> 32:48.520
Since…

32:49.480 --> 32:51.840
she won't return to the Western Capital,

32:52.920 --> 32:54.480
then she doesn't have to.

33:20.600 --> 33:21.680
Good child.

33:23.160 --> 33:24.640
Grandpa's here to take you home.

33:48.320 --> 33:49.280
Back off!

33:49.360 --> 33:50.840
Or I'll take you all with me!

33:52.240 --> 33:53.080
Grandpa!

34:00.920 --> 34:03.160
Grandpa! Grandpa, don't die!

34:25.199 --> 34:26.080
Take him away!

34:34.360 --> 34:35.199
Grandpa…

34:45.600 --> 34:47.040
I killed them.

34:48.800 --> 34:50.040
All four of them,

34:50.560 --> 34:51.920
each deserved to die.

34:52.800 --> 34:54.600
Your daughter is Wu Mujin's birth mother?

34:54.679 --> 34:55.719
Yes.

34:55.800 --> 34:56.800
And she…

34:57.520 --> 34:59.000
They killed her.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.840
My daughter, Xiao Wan,

35:02.920 --> 35:06.120
married into the Suns in Qingtan County
seven years ago.

35:06.880 --> 35:08.800
I built secret mechanisms and tunnels

35:08.880 --> 35:10.320
for manors and estates.

35:10.400 --> 35:12.360
The jobs I took,

35:12.440 --> 35:14.120
some lasted months,

35:15.080 --> 35:16.600
some years.

35:17.680 --> 35:19.320
So I rarely saw her.

35:19.920 --> 35:22.520
When I went to Qingtan to see her
three years ago,

35:22.600 --> 35:25.400
- it had been so long since we last met.
- Hey, in-law!

35:27.400 --> 35:29.720
In-law, why… why are you here?

35:30.320 --> 35:31.520
I finished early.

35:31.600 --> 35:33.000
So I came to see you.

35:34.040 --> 35:35.200
Just a small gift.

35:36.200 --> 35:37.800
- Please accept it.
- You're too kind.

35:40.280 --> 35:41.120
Where's Wan?

35:42.840 --> 35:43.880
I…

35:45.480 --> 35:47.520
She… She's… in the back courtyard.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.600
Wan?

35:50.560 --> 35:51.520
Wan?

35:53.880 --> 35:55.640
Wan? Wan?

35:55.720 --> 35:57.240
XIAO WAN, XIAO'S DAUGHTER

36:05.640 --> 36:06.640
In-law! In-law!

36:06.720 --> 36:09.200
We had no choice! We…

36:14.320 --> 36:15.240
Wan!

36:17.400 --> 36:18.680
Oh my…

36:22.480 --> 36:24.160
What have you done to her?

36:24.240 --> 36:25.520
Let her go!

36:26.480 --> 36:28.640
Father-in-law… Father-in-law…

36:28.720 --> 36:29.800
You…

36:30.880 --> 36:32.400
In-law, let me explain!

36:32.480 --> 36:33.680
In-law, I… She…

36:34.840 --> 36:36.280
In-law!

36:36.360 --> 36:37.720
Xiao Wan's gone mad!

36:37.800 --> 36:39.160
Xiao Wan's gone mad!

36:47.160 --> 36:48.240
Wan?

36:48.960 --> 36:50.160
Wan?

36:57.560 --> 36:58.800
It's me!

37:06.640 --> 37:10.200
They said Wan was weak

37:10.840 --> 37:13.240
and miscarried again and again.

37:14.040 --> 37:15.240
Little by little,

37:16.480 --> 37:18.600
she started losing her mind.

37:19.320 --> 37:20.680
She kept saying

37:20.760 --> 37:22.760
she had a child.

37:22.840 --> 37:25.000
At first, they didn't mind.

37:25.080 --> 37:26.920
Until one day,

37:27.560 --> 37:29.360
Wan ran away from home

37:29.440 --> 37:30.680
and slipped into a rich family's house

37:30.760 --> 37:34.320
in the neighboring county
and tried to take their baby.

37:36.200 --> 37:37.280
In the end,

37:38.520 --> 37:40.040
they reported her to the authorities.

37:41.720 --> 37:42.720
We…

37:43.440 --> 37:46.680
We begged and pleaded
and finally talked her into coming back.

37:46.760 --> 37:49.880
But… after a few days, she ran off again.

37:50.640 --> 37:52.560
This time… she got beaten.

37:53.080 --> 37:55.600
We'd bring her back,
and she'd flee once more.

37:56.200 --> 37:57.800
This happened over and over.

37:58.520 --> 37:59.640
And her mind

37:59.720 --> 38:01.280
got worse and worse.

38:01.800 --> 38:04.040
We saw physicians and gave her medicine,

38:04.120 --> 38:05.480
but nothing worked.

38:05.560 --> 38:08.160
So she wouldn't cause trouble
or get beaten again,

38:08.240 --> 38:10.720
we had to lock her up.

38:10.800 --> 38:13.920
Yes. We had no choice.

38:17.000 --> 38:18.640
I can't leave Wan

38:18.720 --> 38:20.600
with the Sun family anymore.

38:21.240 --> 38:23.080
I want to take her home.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.520
Come.

38:28.480 --> 38:30.400
Come. Take care.

38:34.880 --> 38:35.760
Sit tight.

38:41.920 --> 38:44.560
But when we passed Ping'en County,

38:45.080 --> 38:47.480
Wan jumped off the cart and ran.

38:56.160 --> 38:58.240
Wan? Wan?

39:06.160 --> 39:08.720
Wan! Wan! Wan!

39:08.800 --> 39:10.000
Come on. Stop it.

39:10.080 --> 39:11.160
- Let's go home.
- My child!

39:11.240 --> 39:13.640
- My child's inside…
- There's no child here!

39:13.720 --> 39:16.280
This is someone else's home!
Someone else's home!

39:16.880 --> 39:18.000
Let's go!

39:23.360 --> 39:24.400
Here…

39:38.960 --> 39:40.480
My child…

39:42.640 --> 39:44.200
I'm not crazy!

39:44.880 --> 39:45.920
Father…

39:46.880 --> 39:48.200
That child looks like Wan.

39:48.280 --> 39:49.880
- I'm not crazy…
- It's really alike.

39:50.920 --> 39:52.480
I had to believe

39:53.000 --> 39:55.240
Wan was telling the truth.

39:55.320 --> 39:57.440
But before I could ask…

39:57.520 --> 39:58.440
Hey…

40:00.920 --> 40:02.000
Get away!

40:02.080 --> 40:04.400
- This is my child!
- Wan…

40:05.240 --> 40:07.240
Hey! What are you doing?

40:07.800 --> 40:09.200
Young master, are you alright?

40:10.280 --> 40:11.320
Don't be scared.

40:16.280 --> 40:18.240
- Don't be scared.
- What's wrong with the child?

40:24.200 --> 40:25.120
Mujin.

40:26.520 --> 40:27.880
Tell me.

40:29.120 --> 40:30.840
Do you know this woman?

40:32.440 --> 40:33.360
Speak!

40:40.960 --> 40:41.840
No…

40:45.880 --> 40:47.560
He's not my child!

40:49.280 --> 40:50.560
He's not my child…

40:56.200 --> 40:58.360
I… I have no child.

40:59.680 --> 41:00.560
Wan!

41:02.840 --> 41:03.960
Wan!

41:04.040 --> 41:05.440
Wan!

41:06.560 --> 41:07.600
Wan!

41:20.640 --> 41:21.840
Wan!

41:25.240 --> 41:26.600
Wan!

41:27.800 --> 41:29.240
I can't swim.

41:29.320 --> 41:30.160
Wan!

41:30.240 --> 41:31.280
I couldn't save her.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.320
Wan!

41:32.400 --> 41:35.080
I just stood there, watching her…

41:35.160 --> 41:37.560
Watching her sink, little by little.

41:40.720 --> 41:42.560
You wouldn't understand that feeling,

41:44.160 --> 41:48.000
watching your only family
die right in front of you,

41:48.080 --> 41:51.440
and you can't do anything at all…

41:55.640 --> 41:58.200
So, you chose to avenge Xiao Wan.

41:59.480 --> 42:00.480
Yes.

42:00.560 --> 42:03.120
But finding Mr. Xu wasn't easy.

42:03.640 --> 42:04.560
Someone came to you.

42:07.480 --> 42:08.320
Tell the truth.

42:10.600 --> 42:12.800
I asked around near the Wu house.

42:13.960 --> 42:18.000
Wu Mujin was Wu Siping's illegitimate son.

42:19.120 --> 42:20.240
But the Sun family said

42:21.360 --> 42:23.400
Wan never had a child.

42:24.200 --> 42:25.600
The Sun family lied?

42:27.440 --> 42:28.520
Yes.

42:31.280 --> 42:33.520
The night before Wan was buried,

42:34.120 --> 42:35.640
a woman came to me.

42:37.000 --> 42:39.160
She said she knew Wan

42:39.720 --> 42:41.480
and knew what she'd been through.

42:45.560 --> 42:47.280
That's when I learned

42:47.360 --> 42:49.560
soon after Wan married in,

42:49.640 --> 42:52.520
her husband, Sun Renyi, fell gravely ill.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.120
Physician,

42:54.720 --> 42:55.720
my son's condition…

42:57.800 --> 42:59.720
The medicine costs a fortune.

42:59.800 --> 43:01.280
The Sun family can't afford it.

43:03.360 --> 43:04.240
Renyi?

43:05.080 --> 43:06.000
Renyi?

43:06.080 --> 43:07.880
Renyi…

43:09.120 --> 43:13.720
Lady Sun heard Xu Daoyin was generous,

43:14.240 --> 43:16.560
so she took Wan to pray.

43:17.200 --> 43:19.120
Immortal, bless us.

43:22.000 --> 43:23.280
Don't worry.

43:23.880 --> 43:26.040
The Immortal will surely bless us.

43:27.040 --> 43:28.760
What's wrong with that girl?

43:28.840 --> 43:29.800
Reporting.

43:30.320 --> 43:32.920
That girl has a husband
gravely ill, no money for treatment.

43:33.520 --> 43:34.640
She came to beg Mr. Xu.

43:34.720 --> 43:36.480
She's been coming for a month straight.

43:36.560 --> 43:37.920
That's her mother beside her?

43:38.680 --> 43:40.160
No, it's her in-law.

43:42.680 --> 43:45.040
Tell her she can stay at the manor,
cultivate and build merit for a few days.

43:45.120 --> 43:47.680
